# standard-of-iron
===
 Standard of Iron is an open-source, single-player real-time strategy game in which Rome and Carthage fight across an altered Second Punic War. Command whole formations from above, take direct control of a battlefield commander, build and defend supply lines, and carry Hannibal's army from the Rhône to Zama while the Iron Sepulcher gathers forces.
